        <gr str="5178">brass</gr>; the <gr str="2053">hooks </gr>of the <gr str="5982">pillars </gr>and their <gr str="2838">bands </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">shall be of </STYLE>
        <gr str="3701">silver</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11">And likewise for the <gr str="6828">north </gr>
        <gr str="6285">side </gr>in <gr str="753">length </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">there shall be </STYLE>
        <gr str="7050">hangings </gr>of an <gr str="3967">hundred </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">cubits </STYLE>
        <gr str="753">long</gr>, and its <gr str="6242">twenty </gr>
        <gr str="5982">pillars </gr>and their <gr str="6242">twenty </gr>
        <gr str="134">sockets </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">of </STYLE>
        <gr str="5178">brass</gr>; the <gr str="2053">hooks </gr>of the <gr str="5982">pillars </gr>and their <gr str="2838">bands </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">of </STYLE>
        <gr str="3701">silver</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">And <STYLE css="font-style:italic">for</STYLE> the <gr str="7341">breadth </gr>of the <gr str="2691">court </gr>on the <gr str="3220">west </gr>
